172 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (School of Law, Justice and Governance, Gautam Buddha University invites you to participate in the Campus Recruitment Program 2024-25 which will allow graduating students to show their worth and contribute to your organization. We're excited to provide recruiters with a positive experience and take a step ahead in developing our relationship with the industry. Education in its truest sense is our foremost mission. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (At Gautam Buddha University, dreamers become thinkers, achievers, solvers, pioneers, and influencers. We are devoted to assisting our students to endure imperishable intellectual, societal, and individual transformation. There is phenomenal potential in our students. We stimulate their vision and empower them to actualize their vigor, by infusing experiential, experimental, and inter-disciplinary learning in a research environment. )
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (At the School of Law, Justice & Governance, Gautam Buddha University, education extends beyond the classroom. our strong industry connections, rooted in NCR's corporate landscape, pave the way for unparalleled training and placement opportunities for our students.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
175 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our vision is clear to cultivate world-class scholars and leaders who are not only adept at tackling complex challenges but also possess a deep sense of national, social, cultural, and ecological responsibility. With the unwavering support of our stakeholders, we are confident in our ability to realize this vision.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
