193 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (It is with great pleasure that I present the Placement Brochure for the 2025 batch of the School of Law, Justice, and Governance at Gautam Buddha University. Our institution is committed to providing a comprehensive legal education that equips our students with the knowledge, skills, and ethical grounding necessary to excel in their professional careers.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The Internship and Placement Committee plays a pivotal role in bridging the gap between academia and the professional world. Our dedicated team works tirelessly to ensure that our students are well-prepared to meet the demands of the legal industry. Through a robust internship program, our students gain invaluable hands-on experience and exposure to real-world legal challenges, complementing their rigorous academic training.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
195 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our curriculum is designed to foster critical thinking, legal analysis, and practical skills. We emphasize experiential learning through moot courts, legal aid clinics, and internships with leading law firms, corporate legal departments, and non-governmental organizations. This holistic approach ensures that our graduates are not only proficient in legal theory but also adept at applying their knowledge in practical settings.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
196 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The 2025 graduating batch is a testament to our institution's commitment to excellence. These students have demonstrated outstanding academic achievements, leadership qualities, and a strong commitment to social justice. They have actively participated in various co-curricular and extracurricular activities, including national and international moot court competitions, seminars, and workshops. Their diverse experiences and skills make them highly capable and versatile professionals ready to contribute meaningfully to your organization.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We invite you to explore the profiles of our talented students in this brochure and consider them for opportunities within your esteemed organization. We are confident that they will bring dedication, innovation, and a strong ethical framework to their roles, contributing positively to your team.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
